repository-code: "https://github.com/Ahmed-Reda-SILO/HEMOX"
url: "https://ahmed-reda-silo.github.io/HEMOX/"
abstract: "HEMOX is a wearable, wireless, synchronous dual-site PPG–IMU research platform for bilateral physiological monitoring. The repository includes the Android acquisition and monitoring application, a browser-based validation explorer, a sample HEMOX and commercial pulse-oximetry comparator dataset, and supporting resources for calibration, agreement analysis, motion and signal-quality assessment, and reproducible research reporting."
